    "name": "Episode 4360",
    "overview": "Jonas and Simon got lost in the woods when Simon suddenly collapsed. Jonas didn’t know what to do. He tried to carry Simon, but then had to leave him alone until he finally managed to alert Michael and Carla. At the hospital, the seriousness of the situation hit Valerie like a shock. Seeing Simon so helpless triggered an urge to run away, just when Simon needed her most. Daniel wants to build a house on the estate for Jess and the children. Jess was thrilled, but when Daniel wanted to cancel the boys’ important flag football game to spend time with Jess, she was painfully reminded of her childhood trauma and overreacted. Richard and Julius unexpectedly ended up in bed together. Julius suspiciously suspected another plot, but Richard was genuine, which softened Julius’s heart again. Lilly was preparing for her first time with Nico. Britta left them alone together. But the next morning, Lilly was strangely withdrawn. What had happened?",
